    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40069" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλογ-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λογῐοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					365b
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελογισάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.), <i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> (v. infr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελογίσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.): pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λελόγισμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.15
				</span></i>
			:— <i>reckon over, conclude, consider</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.177
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				44.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				8
			</span></i>,al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄλλα ὀρθῶς ἐ</span>.
			D.H.l.c.; <i>take into account</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο ἐπελογίσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.5.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐπιλογίζεται τὸ
			τέταρτον</span>, of the Egyptian year of <i><span class="en">
				365
			</span></i> days, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				3.56
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δείγμασιν οὐκ ἀμφιβόλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βουλαῖς -λογισθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.428
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>address
				the peroration</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ὀργὴν ἢ ἔλεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theodect.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Rh.
				7.33
			</span></i> W.</div>
